UltraShip U-2 MQTT Bridge
=========================

The original USB-serial UltraShip U-2 packet decoder was written by Timothy
Twillman in 2012 and distributed under the BSD 2-Clause License. Its copyright
notice and license text are preserved in `ultraship_u2v2.py` and `LICENSE`.

The Python 3 port, continuous ASCII protocol support, MQTT/Home Assistant
bridge, Moonraker pause monitor, service files, tests, and documentation were
added in 2026 by the UltraShip U-2 MQTT contributors under the same license.
